WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.190
Waitlists: who is waiting for each full class; a freed seat is offered to the next person automatically.

2
00:00:08.736 --> 00:00:10.850
Look at each class's queue.

3
00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:17.810
To offer by hand, click "Offer a seat"; how long an offer lasts is in the settings.

4
00:00:18.364 --> 00:00:22.640
If the queue is long, open a new class or add "More seats".

5
00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:28.490
A long queue means demand; open a second class before people go elsewhere.
